{"posts":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"6a9ea601a5fd23620b42ff35","text":"Next week, you can join me talking about how we implemented a developer platform in a 200 year old industry. Huge kudos to Roberth Strand, which was my partner-in-crime in creating this speak initially, and one of the big brains behind CNCF Platforms White Paper. \n\nLooking forward to see the beautiful Warsaw again, and also meet some of my amazing friends while I'm there! \n\nHope I'll see you at Code Europe 2026 September 15., in Warsaw!","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-11T07:27:00.000Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7504078118404538369","shareMode":"addToQueue","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9ea5b6e715b5d81f02be5f/5a115761c18da4a49307062186ce5986.original.png","mimeType":"image/png","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9ea5b6e715b5d81f02be5f/5a115761c18da4a49307062186ce5986.original.png"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":10,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":2.68,"unit":"percentage"},{"type":"impressions","name":"Impressions","value":373,"unit":"count"},{"type":"reach","name":"Reach","value":237,"unit":"count"}]}},{"node":{"id":"6a9a8a4b7fcb936adcfedf5e","text":"An eventful week comes to an end. \n\nA lot of interesting questions being raised, for example \"How will AI change DevOps/Platform Engineering?\". Focus is getting more and more on both AI, security and Sovereignity - and FOSS' role in this. I'll take one important tip from Kelsey Hightower: \"Just think!\". It will be important to have people who can think in the future as well. \n\nAnd, Marcus: I'm sorry - Kelsey used about one second to shoot down your \"kube cuddle\" with a \"It's Kube CTL, next question!\"","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7501610200873947136","shareMode":"customScheduled","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a895008c3efde9f005996/bcba25e2f9b8eaa0f16e8138eb0db5e5.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a895008c3efde9f005996/bcba25e2f9b8eaa0f16e8138eb0db5e5.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a8950fa723e07dd0173e4/f9f1cb590e6f394ff573d63d583355b4.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a8950fa723e07dd0173e4/f9f1cb590e6f394ff573d63d583355b4.original.jpg"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":6,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":2.35,"unit":"percentage"},{"type":"impressions","name":"Impressions","value":255,"unit":"count"},{"type":"reach","name":"Reach","value":171,"unit":"count"}]}},{"node":{"id":"6a9801a838c8afd44753c899","text":"Container Days Hamburg 2026 is on! \n\nDifferent location, some new people, some \"old\", the same awsome vibe and so many smart people in one location!\n\nA lot of focus on Sovereign solutions this year, following the trend. BWI first out with a great talk about what they've done for Bundeswehr (German armed forces) with Open Source Software for a secure, sovereign platform.\n\nAnd of course, the mandatory Fritz-kola fridge!\n\n#cds2026 #kubernetes #containersarefun\n\n","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-02T10:59:52.538Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7500870200171548673","shareMode":"shareNow","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800be5bf052e63a08dec0/0b62e04612eccae5141acfa8f59dc804.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800be5bf052e63a08dec0/0b62e04612eccae5141acfa8f59dc804.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c0b2997de3a407cd6c/1549bae770d84e8c8ed0b9e95e92e3c0.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c0b2997de3a407cd6c/1549bae770d84e8c8ed0b9e95e92e3c0.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c49f49bd037b0ef301/e5058b37bf6597b5d454a1a18b374d39.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c49f49bd037b0ef301/e5058b37bf6597b5d454a1a18b374d39.original.jpg"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":10,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":2.44,"unit":"percentage"},{"type":"impressions","name":"Impressions","value":409,"unit":"count"},{"type":"reach","name":"Reach","value":255,"unit":"count"}]}}],"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":true,"endCursor":"WkRFM09EZ3pORFkzT1RJMU16Zz06YVRaaE9UZ3dNV0U0TXpoak9HRm1aRFEwTnpVell6ZzVPUT09"}}}
